{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGO LEAGUE</strong> is a <strong><i>skill-based</i></strong> football game with <strong><i>overpowered abilities</i></strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No player switching, no automation, just you, your skills, and a battlefield full of players all hungry to devour your ego. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth through raw mechanics and decision-making. Every <strong>dribble</strong>, <strong>shot</strong>, and <strong>pass</strong> is controlled by you. There are no assists, no automatic actions, just real-time skill and split-second decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build  your <strong>ego</strong> by crafting your own <strong>unique playstyle</strong>, selecting insane abilities that enhance core gameplay. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting (<i>Kicks, Headers, Bicycle-Kicks</i>)</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All forms of shooting are charged with left click. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick vertically for height, horizontally for curve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.poster.avif?t=1769648452\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.webm?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.mp4?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribbling</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you hold, the more power you put into each touch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the ball with precision or risk being overwhelmed by opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.poster.avif?t=1769648452\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.webm?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.mp4?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapping (receiving passes)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use middle click to absorb incoming passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time it right and you gain control. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcharge and you risk losing momentum, giving your opponent the chance to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.poster.avif?t=1769648452\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.webm?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.mp4?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With endless ways to shoot, from precise curls to high-power rockets, and countless combinations of insane abilities, every match is a new chance to evolve, dominate, and prove whose ego reigns supreme.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Gameplay footage shown is from early development and is highly subject to change.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609530?t=1769648452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/e62cfb79679471f5aa276202a657ed32d22a65ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769648452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/cb5cc143487440c5abf99b0fc4f6b3d97fdcdeed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769648452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/cb5cc143487440c5abf99b0fc4f6b3d97fdcdeed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769648452","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3876000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EGO LEAGUE</strong> is a <strong><i>skill-based</i></strong> football game with <strong><i>overpowered abilities</i></strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No player switching, no automation, just you, your skills, and a battlefield full of players all hungry to devour your ego. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your worth through raw mechanics and decision-making. Every <strong>dribble</strong>, <strong>shot</strong>, and <strong>pass</strong> is controlled by you. There are no assists, no automatic actions, just real-time skill and split-second decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build  your <strong>ego</strong> by crafting your own <strong>unique playstyle</strong>, selecting insane abilities that enhance core gameplay. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shooting (<i>Kicks, Headers, Bicycle-Kicks</i>)</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All forms of shooting are charged with left click. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick vertically for height, horizontally for curve.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.poster.avif?t=1769648452\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.webm?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/aa996f801347f2823bace014dcc11b58.mp4?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dribbling</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you hold, the more power you put into each touch. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the ball with precision or risk being overwhelmed by opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.poster.avif?t=1769648452\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.webm?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/585ed414723fb7278ca228e63635f565.mp4?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapping (receiving passes)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use middle click to absorb incoming passes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time it right and you gain control. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcharge and you risk losing momentum, giving your opponent the chance to strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.poster.avif?t=1769648452\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.webm?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/extras/0555aeab88019e7fb0158062ede637c6.mp4?t=1769648452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With endless ways to shoot, from precise curls to high-power rockets, and countless combinations of insane abilities, every match is a new chance to evolve, dominate, and prove whose ego reigns supreme.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Gameplay footage shown is from early development and is highly subject to change.</p>","developers":["Aaron"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609530/850b327cb5d786b7065f88e3f1a525d602e025d2/header.jpg?t=1769648452","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<s